# Template for the TabPFN variables of a workstation (conda) install.
# The container sets what it needs itself; this file is not used there.
#
# Where they go: copy the lines you need into ~/.Renviron (your home folder),
# not into a .Renviron in this repository. Under `quarto render` a project-level
# .Renviron is read only after Python has been bound, so of these variables
# only HF_TOKEN is reliably picked up from there.
#
# - `.Renviron.example` is only a template. R does not read it.
# - Keep each comment on its own line: R does not strip a comment written after
#   a value, so `TABPFN_NO_BROWSER=1  # note` sets the whole text as the value.
# - Do not leave blank assignments like `TABPFN_TOKEN=` in a real `.Renviron`:
#   an empty value overrides a working one set elsewhere.
# - For TABPFN_CONDA_ROOT, TABPFN_ENV_NAME, TABPFN_PYTHON and TABPFN_MODEL_VERSION
#   a non-empty value in the config (runtime.tabpfn) wins; these variables are
#   read only for a field set to "" (a field left out of the config takes the
#   built-in default: env_name tabflux-tabpfn35-gpu, model_version v3.5).
#   TABPFN_TOKEN and TABPFN_NO_BROWSER have no config field, and HF_TOKEN wins
#   over runtime.tabpfn.hf_token.
#
# TabPFN 3.5, the shipped default.
# TABPFN_TOKEN is the API key of your Prior Labs account. Accept the licence
# once on that account (ux.priorlabs.ai); the package uses the key to confirm
# the acceptance before it downloads the 3.5 weights.
# TABPFN_NO_BROWSER=1 stops the package from trying to open a browser for that
# acceptance, which a render cannot do.
# TABPFN_CONDA_ROOT=/path/to/miniconda3
# TABPFN_ENV_NAME=tabflux-tabpfn35-gpu
# TABPFN_MODEL_VERSION=v3.5
# TABPFN_TOKEN=...
# TABPFN_NO_BROWSER=1
#
# To pin the Python interpreter directly instead of naming the environment:
# TABPFN_PYTHON=/path/to/miniconda3/envs/tabflux-tabpfn35-gpu/bin/python
#
# TabPFN v2.5 only (environment tabflux-tabpfn-gpu, TABPFN_MODEL_VERSION=v2.5).
# HF_TOKEN is a Hugging Face access token; TabFlux stops without it for v2.x.
# HF_TOKEN=hf_xxx
